      "invariants_checked": [
        "Row-level tenant isolation (tenant_id scoping) is enforced across Get*, List*, Update*, Delete*, and batch mutation paths including knowledgeTagRepository.Update, chunkRepository.UpdateChunks (both PostgreSQL VALUES join and row-by-row dialects), and chunkRepository.DeleteChunksByTagID.",
        "Dynamic ORDER BY columns use strict allowlists or clause.Column quoting; all LIKE/ILIKE filters escape %, _, and \\ via escapeLikeKeyword/escapeLikePattern paired with explicit ESCAPE clauses across both PostgreSQL and SQLite dialects, including SearchKnowledge/SearchKnowledgeInScopes fileTypes filters and wiki source_refs prefix lookups.",
        "SQLite (Lite build) and PostgreSQL dialect parity holds across wiki_pages.source_refs queries (ListBySourceRef, ListSlugsBySourceRef, ListSummariesByKnowledgeIDs using json_each/json_valid on SQLite and JSONB containment + escaped text LIKE on PostgreSQL) and TenantRepository.AdjustStorageUsed writer-lock/column-scoped updates.",
        "Empty-slice IN (?) guards, nil query/request struct guards, soft-deleted knowledge_bases join filtering, and integer-overflow-safe pagination offset helpers fail safely without emitting invalid SQL or panicking."
      ],
      "findings": [
        {
          "id": "W3-REPO-TYPES-01",
          "severity": "P1",
          "file": "internal/application/repository/tag.go:28-30; internal/application/repository/chunk.go:563-612, 805",
          "summary": "knowledgeTagRepository.Update called GORM Save(tag) by primary key without tenant_id scoping (allowing a mismatched TenantID to overwrite another workspace's tag and reassign its tenant_id), chunkRepository.UpdateChunks omitted tenant_id predicates in both updateChunksPostgres and updateChunksRowByRow (and panicked on nil slice elements), and DeleteChunksByTagID deleted batch IDs without tenant_id/knowledge_base_id predicates.",
          "regression_test": "TestRepositoryAudit_TagUpdateEnforcesTenantScopeAndCaseInsensitiveSearch, TestRepositoryAudit_ChunkUpdateAndDeleteTenantIsolationAndEmptySlices",
          "commit": "ee17bdabf007b9c5e694ffa08c0aa79b74279ebb"
        },
        {
          "id": "W3-REPO-TYPES-02",
          "severity": "P1",
          "file": "internal/application/repository/tenant.go:164-181",
          "summary": "tenantRepository.AdjustStorageUsed relied on SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (a no-op on SQLite deferred transactions) followed by tx.Save(&tenant), rewriting every column on the tenants row—including chat_history_config outside MessageService's history lock and encrypted credential columns—instead of acquiring a dialect-safe lock and updating only storage_used with int64 overflow/underflow bounds.",
          "regression_test": "TestRepositoryAudit_TenantAdjustStorageUsedPreservesChatHistoryConfigAndClamps",
          "commit": "ee17bdabf007b9c5e694ffa08c0aa79b74279ebb"
        },
        {
          "id": "W3-REPO-TYPES-03",
          "severity": "P1",
          "file": "internal/application/repository/wiki_page.go:526-599, 854-909",
          "summary": "wikiPageRepository.ListBySourceRef, ListSlugsBySourceRef, and ListSummariesByKnowledgeIDs emitted PostgreSQL-only syntax (source_refs @> ?::jsonb and source_refs::text LIKE ? without ESCAPE ?), causing SQLite Lite-mode wiki ingest/retract source_refs queries to fail with syntax errors and leaving LIKE wildcards without an explicit ESCAPE character.",
          "regression_test": "TestRepositoryAudit_WikiPageSourceRefQueriesWorkOnSQLiteAndEscapeWildcards",
          "commit": "ee17bdabf007b9c5e694ffa08c0aa79b74279ebb"
        },
        {
          "id": "W3-REPO-TYPES-04",
          "severity": "P2",
          "file": "internal/application/repository/knowledge.go:379, 388-403, 420, 955-1175; internal/application/repository/message.go:65-78; internal/application/repository/message_artifact.go:261-327; internal/application/repository/session.go:170, 295; internal/application/repository/agent_prompt_repository.go:117-180",
          "summary": "SearchKnowledge and SearchKnowledgeInScopes joined knowledge_bases without filtering knowledge_bases.deleted_at IS NULL (and tenant_id in SearchKnowledge) and built fileTypes LIKE patterns without escaping %/_ wildcards; UpdateKnowledgeBatch left .Debug() enabled; GetMessagesBySession emitted negative OFFSET on page < 1 and LIMIT 0 on pageSize == 0; ListArtifactLibrary compared LOWER(ma.file_type) against un-lowercased FileTypes; and several batch/list methods lacked nil-struct or empty-slice guards.",
          "regression_test": "TestRepositoryAudit_KnowledgeSearchExcludesDeletedKBAndEscapesFileTypeWildcards, TestRepositoryAudit_MessageArtifactSessionAndAgentPromptGuards",
          "commit": "ee17bdabf007b9c5e694ffa08c0aa79b74279ebb"
        }
      ],
      "verification_commands": [
        "GOMAXPROCS=2 go vet -p 1 ./... (exit 0)",
        "GOMAXPROCS=2 go test -race -p 1 -count=1 ./internal/application/repository (exit 0)"
      ]
    },
