      "invariants_checked": [
        "All GORM sql.Scanner implementations across internal/types accept both []byte (PostgreSQL JSONB/BYTEA) and string (SQLite TEXT/JSON affinity) values as well as empty inputs without silently dropping data.",
        "AES-GCM encrypted database column types (ModelParameters, MCPAuthConfig, StorageBackendConfig, TenantSandboxConfig, CredentialsConfig, ConnectionConfig, WebSearchProviderParameters) decrypt enc:v1: payloads identically across PostgreSQL and SQLite drivers and redact secrets in Redacted()/MaskSensitive() helpers.",
